{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:19.260Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Olet soittanut Tervolan terveysasemalle.\nKeräisin esitietoja takaisinsoittoa varten.\nMiten voin auttaa?\n", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": null, "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:35.979Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, nyt on kyllä niin niin tosi kova kurkkukipu ja pitäisi päästä hoitoon.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:37.264Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:39.258Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Keräisin oireistanne tietoja hoitajalle. Mikä oire tai vaiva on kyseessä?", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:49.821Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kurkkukipu.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:50.730Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:27:54.082Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Onko tämä kurkkukipu uusi vaiva, ja kuinka kauan sitä on jatkunut?", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:04.348Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "On uusi ja jatkunut no y 3 päivän.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:05.651Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:09.720Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Onko kurkkukipu viime päivinä muuttunut jotenkin, ja oletteko jo käynytte tai saanutte siihen jotain hoitoa tai tutkimuksia?", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:24.179Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Joo pahentunut päivä päivältä ja en ole vielä saanut mitään hoitoa enkä tutkimuksia.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:25.470Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:29.178Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Eli teillä on uusi kurkkukipu, joka on kestänyt noin kolme päivää ja on pahentunut päivä päivältä, eikä siihen ole vielä saatu hoitoa tai tehty tutkimuksia. Onko tämä oikein?", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:43.209Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kyllä.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:44.100Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:47.323Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos tiedoista. Hoitaja soittaa teille takaisin mahdollisimman pian. Hyvää päivänjatkoa.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T07:28:57.525Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Ei.", "call_sid": "CAcc9a29f2d9fcc69e6670defbb55607e8", "stream_sid": "MZ9c940bd3e6973821ab883c5e5519f627", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
